{"seq":3,"slug":"pattern-matching-records","title":"模式匹配与 Records","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/pattern-matching-records","wordCount":1178,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"模式匹配与-records\">模式匹配与 Records</h1><p>Dart 3.0 同时引入 Records 和 Patterns 并非巧合——Records 提供轻量级的多值聚合，Patterns 提供与之配套的解构与匹配语法。两者共同让 Dart 从纯面向对象语言跨入了代数数据类型的领域。到 Dart 3.12（2026 年 5 月），pattern matching 已在社区中沉淀出成熟的最佳实践，成为日常编码不可或缺的工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇要建立的几张底牌，是理解全部模式语法的入口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Record</td>\n<td>匿名、不可变、结构化类型比较的多值聚合</td>\n<td>零样板的多值返回载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>解构 + 匹配 + 绑定的统一语法</td>\n<td>驱动 switch/if-case/声明的引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>穷尽性</td>\n<td>编译器验证 pattern 覆盖值类型的整个空间</td>\n<td>switch 表达式的安全保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解构三类</td>\n<td>解构型、匹配型、逻辑型</td>\n<td>16 种 pattern 的分类骨架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>_</code> 通配符</td>\n<td>Dart 3.7 起在所有上下文非绑定、可重复声明</td>\n<td>忽略不需要的值的统一写法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：Record 提供可被解构的聚合值，Pattern 提供解构与匹配的语法，穷尽性把匹配的完备性交给编译器而非运行时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"records-零样板的多值返回\">Records：零样板的多值返回</h2><p>Records 是匿名的、不可变的聚合类型，采用<strong>结构化类型</strong>而非名义类型——具有相同字段结构的两个 Record 属于同一类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 位置参数 Record&#10;(String, int, bool) parseConfig(String raw) {&#10;  final parts = raw.split(&#39;:&#39;);&#10;  return (parts[0], int.parse(parts[1]), parts[2] == &#39;true&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 命名字段 Record：更好的可读性&#10;({String host, int port, bool ssl}) parseServerConfig(String url) {&#10;  final uri = Uri.parse(url);&#10;  return (host: uri.host, port: uri.port, ssl: uri.scheme == &#39;https&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 位置参数 Record</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(String, int, bool) parseConfig(String raw) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final parts = raw.split(':');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (parts[0], int.parse(parts[1]), parts[2] == 'true');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 命名字段 Record：更好的可读性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>({String host, int port, bool ssl}) parseServerConfig(String url) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final uri = Uri.parse(url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (host: uri.host, port: uri.port, ssl: uri.scheme == 'https');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Records 的类型相等性基于结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>相等性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>(1, &#39;a&#39;)</code></td>\n<td><code>(int, String)</code></td>\n<td><code>(1, &#39;a&#39;) == (1, &#39;a&#39;)</code> → <code>true</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(name: &#39;x&#39;, age: 1)</code></td>\n<td><code>({String name, int age})</code></td>\n<td>按字段值逐一比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(1, name: &#39;x&#39;)</code></td>\n<td><code>(int, {String name})</code></td>\n<td>位置 + 命名混合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Records 的 <code>hashCode</code> 和 <code>==</code> 由编译器自动派生，基于所有字段的递归相等比较。设 Record <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = (f_1, f_2, ..., f_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1 == r_2 \\iff \\forall i \\in [1,n]: f_{1,i} == f_{2,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">==</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.675em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">==</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Records 适合以下场景：函数多值返回、Map 的复合键、临时的数据分组。当需要方法、验证逻辑或需要被继承时，仍应使用 class。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pattern-语法全景\">Pattern 语法全景</h2><p>Dart 3.x 支持 16 种 pattern 类型，按功能可分为三大类：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Dart Patterns] --&gt; B[解构型]&#10;    A --&gt; C[匹配型]&#10;    A --&gt; D[逻辑型]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Variable Pattern]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[Record Pattern]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[Object Pattern]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[List Pattern]&#10;    B --&gt; B5[Map Pattern]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Constant Pattern]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Relational Pattern]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[Type-test Pattern]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[Null-check Pattern]&#10;    C --&gt; C5[Null-assert Pattern]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Logical-or Pattern]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[Logical-and Pattern]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[Guard clause when]\">graph TD\n    A[Dart Patterns] --&gt; B[解构型]\n    A --&gt; C[匹配型]\n    A --&gt; D[逻辑型]\n    B --&gt; B1[Variable Pattern]\n    B --&gt; B2[Record Pattern]\n    B --&gt; B3[Object Pattern]\n    B --&gt; B4[List Pattern]\n    B --&gt; B5[Map Pattern]\n    C --&gt; C1[Constant Pattern]\n    C --&gt; C2[Relational Pattern]\n    C --&gt; C3[Type-test Pattern]\n    C --&gt; C4[Null-check Pattern]\n    C --&gt; C5[Null-assert Pattern]\n    D --&gt; D1[Logical-or Pattern]\n    D --&gt; D2[Logical-and Pattern]\n    D --&gt; D3[Guard clause when]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>Pattern 类型</th>\n<th>语法示例</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解构</td>\n<td>Variable</td>\n<td><code>var x</code>, <code>final String s</code></td>\n<td>绑定变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解构</td>\n<td>Record</td>\n<td><code>(var a, name: var b)</code></td>\n<td>解构 Record</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解构</td>\n<td>Object</td>\n<td><code>Point(:var x, :var y)</code></td>\n<td>解构类字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解构</td>\n<td>List</td>\n<td><code>[first, ...rest]</code></td>\n<td>解构列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解构</td>\n<td>Map</td>\n<td><code>{&#39;key&#39;: var value}</code></td>\n<td>解构 Map</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配</td>\n<td>Constant</td>\n<td><code>case 42:</code></td>\n<td>精确值匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配</td>\n<td>Relational</td>\n<td><code>&gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; &lt; 100</code></td>\n<td>范围检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配</td>\n<td>Type-test</td>\n<td><code>String s</code></td>\n<td>类型检查+绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配</td>\n<td>Null-check</td>\n<td><code>var x?</code></td>\n<td>非 null 时匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑</td>\n<td>Guard</td>\n<td><code>when condition</code></td>\n<td>附加布尔条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"switch-表达式-穷尽性保证\">Switch 表达式：穷尽性保证</h2><p>Dart 3.0 的 switch 表达式要求穷尽所有可能——编译器会验证 pattern 是否覆盖了值的整个类型空间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// sealed class 保证穷尽&#10;sealed class HttpResult {}&#10;final class Success extends HttpResult {&#10;  final int statusCode;&#10;  final String body;&#10;  Success(this.statusCode, this.body);&#10;}&#10;final class Failure extends HttpResult {&#10;  final int statusCode;&#10;  final String reason;&#10;  Failure(this.statusCode, this.reason);&#10;}&#10;&#10;String summarize(HttpResult result) =&gt; switch (result) {&#10;  Success(statusCode: 200, :var body) =&gt; &#39;OK: ${body.substring(0, 50)}&#39;,&#10;  Success(statusCode: var code, :var body) =&gt; &#39;Status $code: $body&#39;,&#10;  Failure(statusCode: &gt;= 500, :var reason) =&gt; &#39;Server error: $reason&#39;,&#10;  Failure(:var statusCode, :var reason) =&gt; &#39;Client error $statusCode: $reason&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// sealed class 保证穷尽</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class HttpResult {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Success extends HttpResult {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final int statusCode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String body;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Success(this.statusCode, this.body);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Failure extends HttpResult {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final int statusCode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String reason;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Failure(this.statusCode, this.reason);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>String summarize(HttpResult result) => switch (result) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Success(statusCode: 200, :var body) => 'OK: ${body.substring(0, 50)}',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Success(statusCode: var code, :var body) => 'Status $code: $body',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Failure(statusCode: >= 500, :var reason) => 'Server error: $reason',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Failure(:var statusCode, :var reason) => 'Client error $statusCode: $reason',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于非 sealed 类型，使用通配符 <code>_</code> 或显式枚举所有值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 枚举天然支持穷尽检查&#10;enum Priority { low, medium, high, critical }&#10;&#10;String icon(Priority p) =&gt; switch (p) {&#10;  Priority.low =&gt; &#39;📋&#39;,&#10;  Priority.medium =&gt; &#39;⚡&#39;,&#10;  Priority.high =&gt; &#39;🔥&#39;,&#10;  Priority.critical =&gt; &#39;🚨&#39;,&#10;};&#10;// 漏掉任何枚举值 → 编译错误\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 枚举天然支持穷尽检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum Priority { low, medium, high, critical }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>String icon(Priority p) => switch (p) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Priority.low => '📋',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Priority.medium => '⚡',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Priority.high => '🔥',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Priority.critical => '🚨',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 漏掉任何枚举值 → 编译错误</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"if-case-与变量声明中的-pattern\">If-case 与变量声明中的 Pattern</h2><p>Pattern 不仅存在于 switch 中——Dart 3.x 允许在多种上下文中使用 pattern：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// if-case：条件解构&#10;void processJson(Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt; json) {&#10;  if (json case {&#39;status&#39;: int code, &#39;data&#39;: List items} when code == 200) {&#10;    print(&#39;Received ${items.length} items&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 变量声明中的解构&#10;final (latitude, longitude) = getCoordinates();&#10;final (:name, :age) = fetchUserProfile(); // 命名字段解构&#10;&#10;// for 循环中的解构&#10;final scores = {&#39;Alice&#39;: 95, &#39;Bob&#39;: 87, &#39;Carol&#39;: 92};&#10;for (final MapEntry(:key, :value) in scores.entries) {&#10;  print(&#39;$key scored $value&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 赋值中的解构（左值 pattern）&#10;var (x, y) = (0, 0);&#10;(x, y) = (y, x); // 优雅的变量交换\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// if-case：条件解构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void processJson(Map&#x3C;String, dynamic> json) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (json case {'status': int code, 'data': List items} when code == 200) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print('Received ${items.length} items');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 变量声明中的解构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final (latitude, longitude) = getCoordinates();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final (:name, :age) = fetchUserProfile(); // 命名字段解构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// for 循环中的解构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final scores = {'Alice': 95, 'Bob': 87, 'Carol': 92};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (final MapEntry(:key, :value) in scores.entries) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('$key scored $value');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 赋值中的解构（左值 pattern）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var (x, y) = (0, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(x, y) = (y, x); // 优雅的变量交换</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"dart-3-7-通配符变量\">Dart 3.7+ 通配符变量</h2><p>Dart 3.7 统一了通配符变量 <code>_</code> 的语义——<code>_</code> 在所有上下文中都是非绑定的，可以在同一作用域中多次声明而不冲突：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 多个 _ 参数不再冲突&#10;void registerCallback(void Function(int _, String _, bool _) handler) {&#10;  handler(42, &#39;hello&#39;, true);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 构造函数中忽略多个参数&#10;class Logger {&#10;  Logger(String _, int _, {required String tag});&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 模式匹配中的通配符&#10;final (_, second, _) = getTriple(); // 只取第二个值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 多个 _ 参数不再冲突</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void registerCallback(void Function(int _, String _, bool _) handler) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  handler(42, 'hello', true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 构造函数中忽略多个参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Logger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Logger(String _, int _, {required String tag});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 模式匹配中的通配符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final (_, second, _) = getTriple(); // 只取第二个值</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战模式-状态建模与解析\">实战模式：状态建模与解析</h2><p>将 sealed class、Records 和 Patterns 组合使用，可以构建类型安全的解析器和状态机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// JSON 值的代数数据类型表示&#10;sealed class JsonValue {&#10;  factory JsonValue.parse(String source) {&#10;    final trimmed = source.trim();&#10;    if (trimmed == &#39;null&#39;) return JsonNull();&#10;    if (trimmed == &#39;true&#39; || trimmed == &#39;false&#39;) {&#10;      return JsonBool(trimmed == &#39;true&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;    if (double.tryParse(trimmed) case double n) return JsonNumber(n);&#10;    if (trimmed.startsWith(&#39;&quot;&#39;)) return JsonString(trimmed.substring(1, trimmed.length - 1));&#10;    return JsonNull(); // 简化：实际需要处理 array/object&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;final class JsonNull extends JsonValue {}&#10;final class JsonBool extends JsonValue {&#10;  final bool value;&#10;  JsonBool(this.value);&#10;}&#10;final class JsonNumber extends JsonValue {&#10;  final double value;&#10;  JsonNumber(this.value);&#10;}&#10;final class JsonString extends JsonValue {&#10;  final String value;&#10;  JsonString(this.value);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 类型安全的值提取&#10;String display(JsonValue value) =&gt; switch (value) {&#10;  JsonNull() =&gt; &#39;null&#39;,&#10;  JsonBool(:var value) =&gt; value.toString(),&#10;  JsonNumber(:var value) when value == value.roundToDouble() =&gt;&#10;      value.toInt().toString(),&#10;  JsonNumber(:var value) =&gt; value.toStringAsFixed(2),&#10;  JsonString(:var value) =&gt; &#39;&quot;$value&quot;&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// JSON 值的代数数据类型表示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class JsonValue {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  factory JsonValue.parse(String source) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final trimmed = source.trim();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (trimmed == 'null') return JsonNull();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (trimmed == 'true' || trimmed == 'false') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return JsonBool(trimmed == 'true');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (double.tryParse(trimmed) case double n) return JsonNumber(n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (trimmed.startsWith('\"')) return JsonString(trimmed.substring(1, trimmed.length - 1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return JsonNull(); // 简化：实际需要处理 array/object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class JsonNull extends JsonValue {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class JsonBool extends JsonValue {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final bool value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  JsonBool(this.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class JsonNumber extends JsonValue {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final double value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  JsonNumber(this.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class JsonString extends JsonValue {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  JsonString(this.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 类型安全的值提取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>String display(JsonValue value) => switch (value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  JsonNull() => 'null',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  JsonBool(:var value) => value.toString(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  JsonNumber(:var value) when value == value.roundToDouble() =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      value.toInt().toString(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  JsonNumber(:var value) => value.toStringAsFixed(2),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  JsonString(:var value) => '\"$value\"',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能考量\">性能考量</h2><p>Records 和 pattern matching 在编译后不会引入额外运行时开销：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Records 在 AOT 编译后等价于 final class 的实例</li>\n<li>Pattern matching 编译为一系列条件跳转，与手写 <code>if-else</code> 性能相同</li>\n<li>解构操作在编译期内联，不产生中间对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>编译器对 switch 表达式的优化策略依赖于 pattern 的类型：常量 pattern 可能使用跳转表（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），类型测试 pattern 使用线性扫描（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），sealed class 的 pattern 使用子类型标记位检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Records 是匿名、不可变、按结构比较的聚合类型，<code>hashCode</code>/<code>==</code> 由编译器自动派生，适合多值返回、复合键与临时分组；需要方法、验证或继承时仍应使用 class。</li>\n<li>Patterns 覆盖解构型、匹配型、逻辑型三大类共 16 种语法，出现在 switch 表达式、<code>if-case</code>、变量声明、for 循环与赋值左值中。</li>\n<li>switch 表达式要求穷尽：<code>sealed</code> 类与 <code>enum</code> 天然支持编译期验证，其他类型需要通配符或显式枚举所有可能。</li>\n<li>Dart 3.7 起 <code>_</code> 在所有上下文都是非绑定通配符，可在同一作用域重复声明。</li>\n<li>Records 与 pattern matching 在 AOT 后不引入额外运行时开销：Records 等价于 final class 实例，解构在编译期内联，常量 pattern 可能使用跳转表。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"sound-null-safety\">健全空安全与类型系统</a> 了解 pattern 中的 null-check 和 null-assert pattern 如何与空安全交互，以及 <a href=\"classes-mixins-extensions\">类、Mixin 与扩展</a> 了解如何定义适合模式匹配的 sealed 类层次结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模式匹配与 Records","id":"模式匹配与-records"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Records：零样板的多值返回","id":"records-零样板的多值返回"},{"level":2,"text":"Pattern 语法全景","id":"pattern-语法全景"},{"level":2,"text":"Switch 表达式：穷尽性保证","id":"switch-表达式-穷尽性保证"},{"level":2,"text":"If-case 与变量声明中的 Pattern","id":"if-case-与变量声明中的-pattern"},{"level":2,"text":"Dart 3.7+ 通配符变量","id":"dart-3-7-通配符变量"},{"level":2,"text":"实战模式：状态建模与解析","id":"实战模式-状态建模与解析"},{"level":2,"text":"性能考量","id":"性能考量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类、Mixin 与扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/classes-mixins-extensions"},"next":{"title":"Future 与 async/await","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/future-async-await"}}